# Witness: two route sections in one review record

Both route tables below declare all eight areas, so nothing is missing, duplicated or foreign.
What is wrong is that there are two of them: a section lookup that takes its first match can be
pointed at a decoy inserted above the real one, and the table a reviewer actually follows is
then never the table under test.

